Interview questions

Beginner: What is text classification?
Text classification assigns a category to text, such as classifying a customer support ticket as a login issue or payment failure.
Intermediate: Why do we use TF-IDF with Logistic Regression?
TF-IDF converts text into numerical features, and Logistic Regression learns how those features relate to the categories.
Advanced: What would you do if a ticket classifier performs poorly on unseen data?
I would evaluate it on a separate test set, inspect misclassified examples, check class imbalance and data quality, improve the training examples, compare suitable models, and measure precision, recall, and F1-score.
